  "stories": [
    {
      "story_id": "US-001",
      "revision_id": "R1",
      "title": "beacon-v1.3.5-prototype-wireframe-mode-and-prototype-surface-refactor",
      "priority": "medium",
      "status": "accepted",
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "AC-001",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "`prototype` 默认与唯一正式模式是 `wireframe`，不再以 HTML 高保真原型作为交付语义。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260420T095555Z-3e08",
          "verified_by_run_id": "review.accept",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-20T11:28:32.861225+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-005",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "Beacon 人类主链明确包含 `prototype` 阶段，且其职责固定为 wireframe freeze（位于 test-case 与 implement 之间）。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260420T095555Z-3e08",
          "verified_by_run_id": "review.accept",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-20T11:28:32.861225+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-006",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "`beacon-prototype` 成为唯一 host-visible 原型子 skill，默认解释为 requirement-driven wireframe freeze。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260420T095555Z-3e08",
          "verified_by_run_id": "review.accept",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-20T11:28:32.861225+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-007",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "`wireframe.py` 退出正式流程，不再作为平行入口与 `prototype` 竞争语义。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260420T095555Z-3e08",
          "verified_by_run_id": "review.accept",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-20T11:28:32.861225+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-002",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "wireframe 包可独立冻结页面清单、页面职责、路由关系、状态说明，不依赖 HTML 页面。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260420T095555Z-3e08",
          "verified_by_run_id": "review.accept",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-20T11:28:32.861225+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-003",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "每个页面都可追溯到 PRD 承诺、user story 与 test-case 场景，满足 requirement-driven 闭环。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260420T095555Z-3e08",
          "verified_by_run_id": "review.accept",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-20T11:28:32.861225+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-004",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "`v1.3.5` 输出只负责结构冻结，不反向篡改 `v1.3.6` 产品定义，且可被下游直接消费。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260420T095555Z-3e08",
          "verified_by_run_id": "review.accept",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-20T11:28:32.861225+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-008",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "`state-flow-map` 可验证关键状态迁移、异常回退与 test-case 映射；缺失时 `prototype review` 必须阻断。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260420T095555Z-3e08",
          "verified_by_run_id": "review.accept",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-20T11:28:32.861225+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-009",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "`component-catalog` 能建立组件职责/动作/状态与 AC/TC 映射；缺失时 `prototype freeze` 必须失败。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260420T095555Z-3e08",
          "verified_by_run_id": "review.accept",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-20T11:28:32.861225+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-010",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "human/machine/sqlite 三写入点共享 `source_hash`、`projection_seq`、`transaction_id`；任一不一致必须标记 `drift` 并阻断 release pass。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260420T095555Z-3e08",
          "verified_by_run_id": "review.accept",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-20T11:28:32.861225+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
